Release 1.8.1.

Changelog: 24-11-2026 15:16:11

Fixed. A real controller was called fake in many languages other than English. The build date it reports, such as
"May 15 2015", was read with the month names of the window's language, where Mar, May and Oct are no month in Dutch.
The month names are now read in English in every language. The date in the check's detail is written in English too.

