Changelog: 20-11-2026 13:11:18

Release 1.4.0.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 03:44:12

Fixed. The stream's decoder is built from FFmpeg 7.1.5 (was 7.1.2), the newest fix release of the same 7.1 branch, its
tarball's SHA-256 taken and its signature checked against FFmpeg's release key on 20-11-2026; where the system has no
libva headers they come from libva 2.24.1 (was 2.22.0, VA-API 1.24.0). native/ffmpeg/build.sh and build.rs name the
new version, and a test keeps the two the same. The release builds the native core's wheel with it; a checkout's own
build needs native/ffmpeg/build.sh run again, into a folder of its own.

